      <div><p class="mp-kicker">Acquisition International · Global Excellence Awards</p><p class="ex-publisher">CallTeam company announcement · 3 November 2026</p><h1>CallTeam named<br><span>Best Global B2B Outbound Sales Execution Company 2027.</span></h1><p class="mp-lead">Award-winning outreach. More qualified sales conversations.</p><p>CallTeam is a winner in Acquisition International’s 2027 Global Excellence Awards. The award adds to our International Elite 100 and Global 100 wins. Our team brings prospect research, human calling, follow-up and qualification together to create new B2B sales conversations.</p><div class="mp-actions"><a class="mp-button" href="#campaign-evidence" data-award-action="proof">Explore the Campaign Evidence ↓</a><a class="mp-text-link" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="hero">Discuss Your Outbound Campaign ↗</a></div></div>
