  <section class="mp-section" id="recognition"><div class="mp-wrap mp-split"><div><p class="mp-kicker">01 / Our latest award</p><h2>Recognised for B2B<br>outbound sales execution.</h2><p>The award recognises the service at the centre of CallTeam: researching target accounts, reaching decision-makers, qualifying interest and setting the next sales conversation.</p><p>For founders and revenue leaders, that means a team managing the daily outreach behind a stronger pipeline. Acquisition International presents the award through its <a href="{{ globalExcellence.sourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Global Excellence Awards programme</a>.</p></div><aside class="mp-note"><p class="mp-label">CallTeam’s third award</p><h3>Three awards.<br>Focused on your pipeline.</h3><p>Global Excellence Awards 2027 adds to CallTeam’s International Elite 100 2026 and GPMG Global 100 2027 awards.</p><p>Explore our recognition for B2B outbound calling, lead generation and appointment setting.</p><a href="/awards/" data-award-action="recognition">See All CallTeam Awards →</a></aside></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="execution"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">02 / What buyers can expect</p><h2>From target accounts<br>to qualified meetings.</h2><p>CallTeam researches your target accounts, contacts decision-makers and qualifies the next step before handing the conversation to your sales team.</p></div><div class="mp-scope-grid"><article><span class="mp-step">Prepare</span><h3>Reach the right decision-makers.</h3><p>Define the offer, buying roles and account criteria. Research target companies, verify relevant contacts and prepare an opening tied to a business problem.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">Converse</span><h3>Have a real business conversation.</h3><p>Our callers open the discussion, listen to the response, handle objections and follow up. AI-assisted research supports the preparation; people lead the calls and qualify interest.</p></article><article><span class="mp-step">Hand over</span><h3>Send sales into the meeting prepared.</h3><p>Set qualification criteria before outreach starts. Capture the prospect’s business need, reason to meet and agreed next step, then pass that context to your sellers.</p></article></div><p class="mp-caption">Campaign scope, capacity and reporting are agreed before launch. Your sales team takes the lead on discovery, proposals and closing.</p><p>See how <a href="/human-led-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="service">human-led appointment setting</a> works, from the first call to the sales handoff.</p></div></section>
  <section class="mp-section mp-proof" id="campaign-evidence"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">03 / Published campaign evidence</p><h2>See our B2B<br>campaign results.</h2><p>Explore the targeting, outreach and qualification behind three published campaigns.</p></div><div class="ex-proof-grid"><article class="gp-stat-block"><p class="mp-label">B2B SaaS</p><strong class="ex-number">11</strong><h3>qualified demos<br>in 90 days.</h3><p>The campaign generated four sales opportunities. Two customers signed within six months.</p><a href="/case-studies/saas-demo-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="proof">Read the SaaS Campaign →</a></article><article class="gp-stat-block"><p class="mp-label">Manufacturing cybersecurity</p><strong class="ex-number">9</strong><h3>qualified appointments<br>in the first 90 days.</h3><p>Three appointments progressed into sales opportunities with manufacturing buyers.</p><a href="/case-studies/manufacturing-cybersecurity-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="proof">Read the Cybersecurity Campaign →</a></article><article class="gp-stat-block"><p class="mp-label">HR software</p><strong class="ex-number">9</strong><h3>booked product demos<br>in the first 90 days.</h3><p>The campaign also produced two proposals.</p><a href="/case-studies/hr-software-lead-generation/" data-award-action="proof">Read the HR Software Campaign →</a></article></div><p class="mp-proof-note">These are separate client engagements, with meeting definitions and reporting periods shown for each. Client names are confidential.</p></div></section>
