  <section class="mp-section mp-paper" id="services"><div class="mp-wrap"><div class="mp-heading"><p class="mp-kicker">05 / Put the experience to work</p><h2>Build your next<br>B2B sales campaign.</h2><p>Choose the outbound work your team needs managed, from buyer research and calling to qualified meetings and sales handoff.</p></div><div class="ex-service-grid"><a href="/services/b2b-cold-calling/" data-award-action="service"><strong>B2B outbound calling</strong><span>Decision-maker conversations, objection handling and follow-up.</span></a><a href="/services/b2b-lead-generation/" data-award-action="service"><strong>B2B lead generation</strong><span>Target-account research, contact preparation and outbound outreach.</span></a><a href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/" data-award-action="service"><strong>Appointment setting</strong><span>Meeting qualification, booking and a clear handoff to sales.</span></a><a href="/services/outsourced-sdr/" data-award-action="service"><strong>Outsourced SDR services</strong><span>Managed prospecting, outreach and sales qualification.</span></a></div><div class="mp-tool-band"><div><h3>Plan your campaign.</h3><p>Use the campaign planner to outline your offer, target buyers and outreach approach. Review <a href="/pricing/" data-award-action="service">campaign pricing</a> to see the starting scope and budget.</p></div><a class="mp-button" href="/b2b-outbound-campaign-planner/" data-award-action="tool">See How We’d Run Your Campaign ↗</a></div></div></section>
